{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {

    },
    "Adds a study record with a subject and study time without using the stopwatch. You can also choose the date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adds a study record with a subject and study time without using the stopwatch. You can also choose the date."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ストップウォッチを使わずに、教材と学習時間を指定して学習記録を追加します。日付も指定できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the Record, Statistics, Goals, or History tab in Studies." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens the Record, Statistics, Goals, or History tab in Studies."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Studiesの記録・統計・目標・履歴タブを開きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the study session screen for the chosen subject in Studies." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens the study session screen for the chosen subject in Studies."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Studiesで、選んだ教材の学習セッション画面を開きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts the study stopwatch for the chosen subject and shows the elapsed time in a Live Activity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starts the study stopwatch for the chosen subject and shows the elapsed time in a Live Activity."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選んだ教材の学習ストップウォッチを開始し、経過時間をライブアクティビティに表示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the current study session and saves the elapsed time as a study record." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stops the current study session and saves the elapsed time as a study record."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "実行中の学習セッションを終了し、経過時間を学習記録として保存します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tells you how long you've studied today and your progress toward today's goal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tells you how long you've studied today and your progress toward today's goal."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日の合計学習時間と、今日の目標に対する達成率を伝えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」と優先度が重複しています。\n\n同じ曜日に適用される複数のスケジュールが同じ優先度を持つことはできません。異なる優先度を設定してください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” has the same priority.\n\nMultiple schedules applied on the same day can’t share the same priority. Please choose a different priority."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」に一致する教材がありません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No subjects match “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」の学習を継続しますか？\nストップウォッチのカウントは保存されています。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Continue studying “%@”?\nYour stopwatch progress has been saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を削除します。この教材の学習記録は保持されますが、履歴には「削除された教材」として表示されるようになります。この操作は取り消せません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” will be deleted. Study records for this subject will be kept, but will show as “Deleted Subject” in your history. This action can’t be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
